oute-3"><div class="route-art"><img src="/assets/tao-ming.webp" alt="à¹‚à¸£à¸‡à¹€à¸£à¸µà¸¢à¸™à¹€à¸•à¹‰à¸²à¸«à¸¡à¸´à¸‡" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy"><span class="route-no">03</span></div><div class="route-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Trace buildings, trade, and people</span><h3>Old Buildings and Riverside Market Route</h3><span class="route-footer">6 destinations <span aria-hidden="true">â†—</span></span></div></a><a class="route-card" href="/en/routes/#route-4"><div class="route-art"><img src="/assets/khun-in.webp" alt="à¸šà¹‰à¸²à¸™à¸‚à¸¸à¸™à¸­à¸´à¸™à¸—à¸£à¹Œ" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="route-no">04</span></div><div class="route-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Best for a half-day visit</span><h3>Short walk from wooden house</h3><span class="route-footer">4 destinations <span aria-hidden="true">â†—</span></span></div></a></div></section><section class="section city-feed" id="city-feed"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="chapter">02 / Read the town</span><h2>City topics and news</h2></div><p>Compiled stories and the latest updates in Takua Pa</p></div><div class="city-feed-grid"><div class="cf-stories"><h3 class="cf-title">Stories of the City</h3><div class="story-tiles"><a class="story-tile story-tile-lead" href="/en/stories/city/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/riverwalk.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="chapter">Know the city</span><b>Takua Pa: The Town That Moved with the River</b><p>From an ancient settlement on the trans-peninsular route to a market and mining town Â· Verified facts and questions waiting to be answered.</p><small>6 minutes</small></span></a><a class="story-tile" href="/en/stories/architecture/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/culture-street.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="chapter">Old houses and architecture</span><b>Buildings built with tin money and dredger steel Â· Architecture that remembers the town</b><p>R